  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Sustainable Pacific Coexistence and the Empowerment of Displaced Youth in the Communes of Littoral and Western Regions of Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen peaceful coexistence between displaced young men and women, from North-West and South-West regions of Cameroon, and the young individuals in host communities in the Littoral and Western regions of the country. The project seeks to produce a series of changes in the short, medium, and long term with the overarching goal to contribute to better integration of displaced young people in their host communities and establish a culture of lasting peace.</narrative>
  </description>
